The work contains:

- a machine-readable metadata frame;
- the query and date;
- an unedited AI Overview;
- an arranged search-result chorus;
- witness commentary;
- formal analysis;
- an uptake argument;
- a full artifact addendum.

Its authorship model separates:

- source phrase;
- machine arrangement;
- human recognition and curation.

The work treats metadata, timestamps, snippets, attribution, and search ordering as poetic material.
